{"id":"8cb8a2ec6873cc10ebfc7c91900f3cb883e9013b","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1243393","title":"一口气用 GPT-6 Astra 做了 10 款小游戏，欢迎来玩","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"iiduce","excerpt":"分享创造 - @iiduce - 上个月升级了 pro 20x ，tibo 又不断给重置，生产力爆棚，token 无处可去，决定做些小游戏。https://tz100.com 已上线的 10 款小游戏全部使用 GPT-6 A","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Main\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>上个月升级了 pro 20x ，tibo 又不断给重置，生产力爆棚，token 无处可去，决定做些小游戏。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://tz100.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://tz100.com</a>  已上线的 10 款小游戏全部使用 GPT-6 Astra 完成（包括站点也是）。总共消耗了大约 20x 的两个周额度</p>\n<p>其中五子棋和象棋支持在线开房联机。乒乓球也做了联机，但是测试对网络要求太高，上线关闭了联机功能。</p>\n<p>晴湾防线（ <a href=\"https://tz100.com/zh/games/sunharbor-defense\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://tz100.com/zh/games/sunharbor-defense</a> ） 致敬（模仿）了我非常喜欢的一款古老 flash 塔防游戏，不知谁能看出来。</p>\n<p>所有游戏大多反复调试，达到可玩级别，非几句话许愿完成，欢迎来玩，提提意见。</p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18106843\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c99a/8a5a/117690_normal.png?m=1449334428\" alt=\"ainimuyan\" data-uid=\"117690\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ainimuyan\">ainimuyan</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-20 17:41:28 +08:00\">18h 45m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>真是浪费 token 啊，现在我都是看着用量规划任务，主线任务都不够用的，真羡慕你这样挥洒自如哈哈哈</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18107052\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4f16/c818/1085_normal.png?m=1760330213\" alt=\"iiduce\" data-uid=\"1085\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/iiduce\">iiduce</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-20 18:48:10 +08:00\">17h 38m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>@<a href=\"/member/nakun233\">nakun233</a> 重在规划，总结流程。</p><p>前两三个游戏大约耗费了 1 个周额度，一边做，一边让 AI 设计总结最佳实践及整站小游戏的约束，写成文档。后面只需策划整理游戏创意，一次性出来的成品就不会太离谱。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18107162\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/50b2/17bc/57142_normal.png?m=1789707624\" alt=\"xming\" data-uid=\"57142\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xming\">xming</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-20 19:36:13 +08:00\">16h 50m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>收购 小游戏源码 **微信 (WeChat)**：bantian0921</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18107164\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/50b2/17bc/57142_normal.png?m=1789707624\" alt=\"xming\" data-uid=\"57142\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xming\">xming</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-20 19:36:54 +08:00\">16h 50m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>楼主 我关注你很多年了，之前这个网址是做导购的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_